{
    "chapter_num": 27,
    "verses_count": 12,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "David Allied with the Philistines"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And David said in his heart, “Now I shall perish someday by the hand of Saul. "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "There is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " nothing better for me than that I should speedily escape to the land of the Philistines; and Saul will "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "despair of searching for"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "despair of me, to seek me anymore in any part of Israel. So I shall escape out of his hand.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then David arose and went over with the six hundred men who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with him to Achish the son of Maoch, king of Gath. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So David dwelt with Achish at Gath, he and his men, each man with his household, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " David with his two wives, Ahinoam the Jezreelitess, and Abigail the Carmelitess, Nabal’s widow. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And it was told Saul that David had fled to Gath; so he sought him no more."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then David said to Achish, “If I have now found favor in your eyes, let them give me a place in some town in the country, that I may dwell there. For why should your servant dwell in the royal city with you?” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Achish gave him Ziklag that day. Therefore Ziklag has belonged to the kings of Judah to this day. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. the number of days"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the time that David dwelt in the country of the Philistines was one full year and four months."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And David and his men went up and raided the Geshurites, the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or Gezrites"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Girzites, and the Amalekites. For those "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "nations"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " were the inhabitants of the land from "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "ancient times"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of old, as you go to Shur, even as far as the land of Egypt. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Whenever David "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. struck"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "attacked the land, he left neither man nor woman alive, but took away the sheep, the oxen, the donkeys, the camels, and the apparel, and returned and came to Achish. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Achish would say, “Where have you made a raid today?” And David would say, “Against the southern "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "area"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of Judah, or against the southern "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "area"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the Jerahmeelites, or against the southern "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "area"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the Kenites.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "David would save neither man nor woman alive, to bring "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "news"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to Gath, saying, “Lest they should inform on us, saying, ‘Thus David did.’ ” And thus "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " his behavior all the time he dwelt in the country of the Philistines. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Achish believed David, saying, “He has made his people Israel utterly abhor him; therefore he will be my servant forever.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}